flowchart TD
A_Start["**Start MOO Optimization**
Begin multi objective search over buffer capacities"]
A1_DefineObjectives["**Define Objectives**
Set objectives:
Maximize throughput
Minimize average WIP"]
A2_DefineDecisionVars["**Define Decision Variables**
Select buffer capacities as decision variables
Buffers: PostLoadingBuffer, PostConveyorBuffer, PostWashingBuffer, PrePress1Buffer, PrePress2Buffer, PostPress12Buffer
Each capacity in discrete range {1-10}"]
A3_DefineConstraints["**Define Constraints**
Keep existing machine parameters fixed
Maintain simulation time and warmup
Enforce integer capacities and feasible ranges"]
A4_InitPopulation["**Initialize Population**
Generate initial set of candidate solutions
Each candidate has vector of 6 buffer capacities
Random or space filling assignment in {1-10}"]
B_MOOLoop["**MOO Algorithm Loop**
Iterative search cycle
Run until max generations or convergence"]
B1_SelectSolution["**Select Candidate**
Choose one candidate solution from population
Example: via tournament or Pareto based selection"]
B2_ApplyConfig["**Apply Buffer Configuration**
Map candidate capacities to simulation model:
PostLoadingBuffer.cap = x1
PostConveyorBuffer.cap = x2
PostWashingBuffer.cap = x3
PrePress1Buffer.cap = x4
PrePress2Buffer.cap = x5
PostPress12Buffer.cap = x6"]
B3_SetupSim["**Setup Simulation Environment**
Create new SimPy environment
Instantiate buffers and machines
Wire splitter and merger to press buffers
Attach part_generator and sampling process"]
B4_RunRepLoop["**Run Replications**
For robustness run multiple seeds for this candidate
Accumulate KPIs over replications"]
B4a_SetSeed["**Set Random Seed**
Combine base seed and replication index
Ensure independent randomness for each run"]
B4b_RunSimulation["**Run Simulation**
Call run_simulation with current seed
Use configured buffer capacities
Collect result metrics"]
B4c_CollectMetrics["**Collect KPIs**
Extract:
Throughput from result.overall.throughput
WIP from result.overall.wip
Optionally energy and bottleneck info for analysis"]
B4d_CheckMoreReps["**More Replications For Candidate**
Have required number of replications been executed
for this candidate"]
B5_AggregateMetrics["**Aggregate Candidate Performance**
Compute mean throughput across replications
Compute mean WIP across replications
Store objectives for this candidate"]
B6_EvaluatePopulation["**Evaluate Population**
Gather objectives for all candidates
Identify dominance relationships
Compute Pareto front and crowding measures"]
B7_SelectParents["**Select Parents**
Use Pareto ranking and diversity measures
Choose parent solutions for variation operators"]
B8_GenerateOffspring["**Generate Offspring**
Create new candidate buffer sets from parents
Use crossover and mutation on capacities"]
B8a_Crossover["**Crossover Operator**
Combine parent capacity vectors:
Child xi from parent1 or parent2
Maintain discrete values and ranges"]
B8b_Mutation["**Mutation Operator**
Randomly change some capacities by small integer steps
Clamp mutated values to {1-10}"]
B9_FormNewPopulation["**Form New Population**
Merge parents and offspring
Select next generation via Pareto and diversity criteria"]
B10_CheckStopping["**Check Stopping Criteria**
If max generations reached or
Pareto front stable then stop
Else continue loop"]
C_StorePareto["**Store Pareto Optimal Set**
Save non dominated solutions
Each solution has buffer capacities and
associated throughput and WIP"]
C1_SelectTradeoff["**Select Preferred Trade Off**
Optionally choose specific solution:
For example via weighted scoring or
decision maker preference on throughput vs WIP"]
C2_ReportConfig["**Report Best Buffer Configuration**
Output selected buffer capacities:
PostLoadingBuffer, PostConveyorBuffer,
PostWashingBuffer, PrePress1Buffer,
PrePress2Buffer, PostPress12Buffer"]
C3_IntegrateIntoCode["**Integrate Into Simulation Code**
Update default capacities in production model
Or provide configuration interface so that
run_simulation uses optimized capacities"]
C_End["**End**
Optimization finished
Optimized buffer configuration available for use"]


A_Start --> A1_DefineObjectives
A1_DefineObjectives --> A2_DefineDecisionVars
A2_DefineDecisionVars --> A3_DefineConstraints
A3_DefineConstraints --> A4_InitPopulation
A4_InitPopulation --> B_MOOLoop

B_MOOLoop --> B1_SelectSolution
B1_SelectSolution --> B2_ApplyConfig
B2_ApplyConfig --> B3_SetupSim
B3_SetupSim --> B4_RunRepLoop

B4_RunRepLoop --> B4a_SetSeed
B4a_SetSeed --> B4b_RunSimulation
B4b_RunSimulation --> B4c_CollectMetrics
B4c_CollectMetrics --> B4d_CheckMoreReps
B4d_CheckMoreReps -- No --> B4a_SetSeed
B4d_CheckMoreReps -- Yes --> B5_AggregateMetrics

B5_AggregateMetrics --> B6_EvaluatePopulation
B6_EvaluatePopulation --> B7_SelectParents
B7_SelectParents --> B8_GenerateOffspring
B8_GenerateOffspring --> B8a_Crossover
B8a_Crossover --> B8b_Mutation
B8b_Mutation --> B9_FormNewPopulation
B9_FormNewPopulation --> B10_CheckStopping
B10_CheckStopping -- No --> B1_SelectSolution
B10_CheckStopping -- Yes --> C_StorePareto

C_StorePareto --> C1_SelectTradeoff
C1_SelectTradeoff --> C2_ReportConfig
C2_ReportConfig --> C3_IntegrateIntoCode
C3_IntegrateIntoCode --> C_End